## Netlify redirects and headers — HTTPS + www → apex

# Force HTTP to HTTPS (Netlify handles this automatically when "Force HTTPS" is
# enabled in site settings, but this makes it explicit)
http://moscath.com/*        https://moscath.com/:splat    301!
http://www.moscath.com/*    https://moscath.com/:splat    301!
https://www.moscath.com/*   https://moscath.com/:splat    301!

# Custom 404 — tells Netlify to serve 404.html with a real 404 status code
/*    /404.html    404
